2. Validate that array fields (`page_assets`, `source_artifacts`, `depends_on_issues`) are actually arrays if present, failing closed with a specific error code if they are not.
3. Explicitly verify that all expected source artifact roles are present in `manifest.source_artifacts` rather than relying solely on array length checks.
